From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: DeepSeek Harness <noreply@deepseek.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 18:47:59 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(app): GitHub-style heatmap cell tooltip and page-tinted
 theme preview

- Replace the Toast shown when a heatmap day is tapped with an anchored
  bubble: near-black rounded bubble, white text, a notch pointing at the
  tapped cell, placed above it (below when there is no room), moving on a
  second tap, and dismissed by outside touch, scrolling, back, rotation or
  when the card is rebound.
- Let the notch follow the cell even when the bubble has to be clamped to
  the window edge, so edge cells are no longer pointed at the wrong column.
- Put the theme preview (theme page strip and custom theme editor stage) on
  the page background instead of the accent color or a hardcoded dark, so it
  matches the home background in light mode and stays dark in dark mode.
